+	//  - in the app bundle's Resources folder
+	//  - in ~/Library/Application Support/Amnesia The Dark Descent
+	//  - in the folder the app is in
+	//  - in the current directory (running the bare executable)
+	// Saves and settings go in ~/Library/Application Support/Frictional Games/Amnesia,
